.key args/F
.bra {
.ket }
; Python needs a deep stack; the default 256 KB dies inside the parser.
Stack 16000000
; OpenSSL's compiled-in default CA path is a build path that does not exist on
; the target. Point it at the CA bundle shipped in this package.
SetEnv SSL_CERT_FILE /Python/ssl/ca-bundle.crt
; No -u here. On ABIv11 the console is a tty to
; posixc, so stdout is line buffered anyway, and -u made posixc leave the
; Shell's own output handle unbuffered after exit: the prompt's colour codes
; were then written in pieces and shown as text.
Python:python {args}
